---
import BlogPost from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

// Figures match the item pages on this site.
const menu = [
  { name: 'Breakfast Burrito', href: '/items/breakfast-burrito', price: '$3.49', cal: '380' },
  { name: 'Biscuit & Gravy', href: '/items/biscuit-gravy', price: '$3.99', cal: '400' },
  { name: 'Buttermilk Pancake Platter', href: '/items/buttermilk-pancake-platter', price: '$5.49', cal: '680' },
  { name: 'Ultimate Hash Browns Platter', href: '/items/ultimate-hash-browns-platter', price: '$5.99', cal: '790' },
  { name: 'Country Breakfast Platter', href: '/items/country-breakfast-platter', price: '$6.99', cal: '860' },
];

const faqs = [
  { q: 'Does Dairy Queen serve breakfast?', a: 'Some do. Breakfast is served at select DQ Grill & Chill restaurants, mostly in the South and Midwest. Most DQ locations, and all Treat-only stores, do not serve breakfast.' },
  { q: 'What time does Dairy Queen stop serving breakfast?', a: 'At locations that serve it, breakfast usually ends around 10:30 or 11 AM. Each franchise sets its own hours, so check your store on the DQ app or call ahead.' },
  { q: 'What is on the Dairy Queen breakfast menu?', a: 'Common items include breakfast burritos, biscuits and gravy, pancake platters, hash brown platters and country breakfast platters with eggs, meat and a biscuit. The menu varies by location.' },
  { q: 'How do I find a Dairy Queen that serves breakfast?', a: 'Open the DQ app or the store locator, choose a nearby DQ Grill & Chill and look at its menu and hours. If breakfast items are listed, that store serves breakfast.' },
];
---
<BlogPost
  title="Dairy Queen Breakfast Hours & Menu (2026 Guide)"
  description="Does Dairy Queen serve breakfast? Which DQ locations do, typical breakfast hours, and the breakfast menu with prices and calories."
  h1="Dairy Queen Breakfast Hours and Menu"
  crumb="DQ Breakfast Hours"
  eyebrow="Breakfast at DQ"
  image="/Images/country-breakfast-platter.webp"
  imageAlt="Dairy Queen Country Breakfast Platter with eggs, sausage, biscuit and gravy"
  datePublished="2026-04-12"
  faqs={faqs}
>
  <p class="lead"><strong>Some Dairy Queen restaurants serve breakfast, usually from opening until about 10:30 or 11 AM.</strong> Breakfast is only available at select DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations, mostly in the South and Midwest. Treat-only stores never serve it. If your DQ does, expect burritos, biscuits and gravy, pancakes and big country platters.</p>

  <h2 id="hours">Dairy Queen breakfast hours</h2>
  <p>There are no set national breakfast hours. Each franchise decides when to open and when to switch to lunch. At stores that serve breakfast, these are typical:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Weekdays:</strong> from opening (often 6 or 7 AM) until around 10:30 AM.</li>
    <li><strong>Weekends:</strong> often a little later, until around 11 AM.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Check the DQ app or call your store before you go. Our <a href="/locations">DQ location guide</a> explains how to find a nearby store and its hours.</p>

  <h2 id="which-stores">Which Dairy Queens serve breakfast?</h2>
  <p>Only full-size <strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill</strong> restaurants have the kitchen for breakfast, and only some of them choose to offer it. It is most common in Texas and other Southern and Midwestern states. <strong>DQ Treat</strong> stores, including mall kiosks, sell only frozen treats and open later.</p>

  <h2 id="menu">Dairy Queen breakfast menu and prices</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Typical price</th><th>Calories</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{menu.map((m) => <tr><td><strong><a href={m.href}>{m.name}</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">{m.price}</td><td>{m.cal}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="what-to-order">What to order</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Quick and cheap:</strong> the <a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">breakfast burrito</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Classic Southern breakfast:</strong> <a href="/items/biscuit-gravy">biscuits and gravy</a>, made with the same peppery country gravy DQ serves with chicken strips.</li>
    <li><strong>Hungry:</strong> the <a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a> with eggs, meat, a biscuit and hash browns.</li>
    <li><strong>Sweet:</strong> the <a href="/items/buttermilk-pancake-platter">pancake platter</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>See the full <a href="/categories/breakfast">Dairy Queen breakfast menu</a>, or check the <a href="/blog/dq-meal-deals-guide">DQ meal deals</a> once lunch starts.</p>
</BlogPost>
